                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. A creature that Casts a Spell in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:20] save. On a failure, the creature takes @Damage[1d4[mental]] damage per rank of the spell cast (and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round on a critical failure).If a creature who takes mental damage from thaumogen haze is Casting a Spell that deals damage, it gains a status bonus to the spell's damage equal to the spell's rank. A creature can choose to willingly fail this save.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.Effect: Thaumogen Haze]</p>"
